@GosubToModifyPerspectiveStageCamera Index:0 LookCharacterId:Noah Composition:Left RollDirection:Right ZoomLevel:3
@PrintDebateText Text:那、那是……<br>那个、那个……|#0205Trial06_Noah003| RevealSpeed:1 ScenePosition:70,50 Roll:4

@ModifyCharacterExtended Lazy:false IdAndAppearance:CreatureHiro.11
@GosubToModifyPerspectiveStageCamera Index:0 LookCharacterId:Hiro Composition:Right RollDirection:Left ZoomLevel:3
@PrintDebateText Text:……然后，<br>那些被世人称赞的画作，<br>是用魔法画出来的。|#0205Trial06_Hiro002| RevealSpeed:1 ScenePosition:30,50 Roll:-4

