@GosubToModifyPerspectiveStageCamera Index:0 LookCharacterId:Noah Composition:Left RollDirection:Right ZoomLevel:3
@PrintDebateText Text:呜呜——！？|#0205Trial06_Noah004| RevealSpeed:1 ScenePosition:70,50 Roll:4

@ModifyCharacterExtended Lazy:false IdAndAppearance:CreatureHiro.18
@GosubToModifyPerspectiveStageCamera Index:0 LookCharacterId:Hiro Composition:Right RollDirection:Left ZoomLevel:3
@PrintDebateText Text:这些画不能说是你画的……<br>我说得没错吧。|#0205Trial06_Hiro003| RevealSpeed:1 ScenePosition:30,50 Roll:-4

@ModifyCharacterExtended Lazy:false IdAndAppearance:Noah.Default,ArmR2,ArmL2,Angle01/Facial/Eyes>Eyes_Pensive_Open,Angle01/Facial/Mouth>Mouth_Pensive_Open,Angle01/Facial/Sweat>Sweat01
@GosubToModifyPerspectiveStageCamera Index:0 LookCharacterId:Noah Composition:Left RollDirection:Right ZoomLevel:3
@PrintDebateText Text:这、这……|#0205Trial06_Noah005| RevealSpeed:1 ScenePosition:70,50 Roll:4

@ModifyCharacterExtended Lazy:false IdAndAppearance:Noah.Default,ArmR2,ArmL4,Angle01/Facial/Eyes>Eyes_Pensive_Open,Angle01/Facial/Mouth>Mouth_Surprised_Open02,Angle01/Facial/Sweat>Sweat01
@GosubToModifyPerspectiveStageCamera Index:0 LookCharacterId:Noah Composition:Left RollDirection:Right ZoomLevel:3
@PrintDebateText Text:"不、不对哦！？<br>诺亚，<br><link=\"Objection_02_05_06_01\">超喜欢画画</link>的！！|#0205Trial06_Noah006|" RevealSpeed:1 ScenePosition:70,50 Roll:4

